        "recordSha256": "5f10e7a12358f7bd82f13be334b76333d804de4b56f2e17b2d33d2ef2832cd41",
        "individualQuestion": "Preserve forcing ALL CREATURES IN30FT RADIUS TO REVEAL TRUE ALIGNMENT; Core Action/range30ft/Instantaneous. Define center,recipient display,line of effect,save if NEW and exact alignment information exposed from native records. Resolve disguises,suppression,temporary alignment effects and protections without reading beliefs as a substitute for a mechanical alignment field. Compare reviewed single-target Alignment Revelation and pending Alignment Immunity/Mind Blank explicitly. Preserve all-creatures scope rather than enemies-only; no hidden creature location or unrelated moral history is automatically revealed. Revelation does not change alignment,oaths,consent or faction reputation."
      },
      "completeHistoricalCommonQuestionUnchanged": "For every selected spell, settle all operational fields: actual activation and components, legal target/range/geometry, duration and concentration, resolution/DC/save or attack, full effect clauses, scaling, repeat casting/source identity, suppression/ending, limits and class-specific rank/cost access. Preserve printed clauses and every original source. Explicitly label NEW completions; no external-game import or automatic historical alias merge.",
