        "individualQuestion": "Preserve a+10 INSIGHT BONUS TO ONE ROLL; Core Action/120ft/Instantaneous. Define recipient and finite window,which roll categories qualify (attack,save,check,initiative,damage or otherwise),and declaration timing before/after die or result. Retain the full+10 and one-roll limit. Resolve advantage/multiple dice,rerolls,opposed rolls,natural outcomes,critical degrees and existing modifier comparison families without stacking several copies or transferring an expended bonus. Casting as an Action needs a concrete relationship to the later roll. Insight provides the numeric benefit,not extra hidden information,automatic success or retroactive permission to attempt an impossible task."
      },
