        "recordSha256": "7aff650c09536d528a0850dbbcd14580a8b6a199be918940bafa726411a528d7",
        "individualQuestion": "Preserve COMMUNICATING TELEPATHICALLY WITH ANY CREATURE; Core Action/120ft/Instantaneous. Define target count,selection,initial versus continuing range,finite duration/concentration and whether communication is two-way. Specify language comprehension,mental imagery,unwilling recipients,unconsciousness and ability to decline replies while retaining the broad any-creature promise. Distinguish sending/receiving messages from mind reading,truth verification,compulsion or sensing exact location. Resolve mental protections,communication-blocking conditions and later separation without granting hidden facts or speech-based spell components automatically. Do not import an unlimited same-plane bond or new planar communication scope."
      },
      "completeHistoricalCommonQuestionUnchanged": "For every selected spell, settle all operational fields: actual activation and components, legal target/range/geometry, duration and concentration, resolution/DC/save or attack, full effect clauses, scaling, repeat casting/source identity, suppression/ending, limits and class-specific rank/cost access. Preserve printed clauses and every original source. Explicitly label NEW completions; no external-game import or automatic historical alias merge.",
