        "individualQuestion": "Preserve YOU AND ONE ALLY REPEATING THE FULL LAST ROUND OF ACTIONS; Core Action/120ft/Instantaneous. Define exactly which historical round and actions,movement,Bonus Actions and Reactions are repeated,and when those repetitions resolve. Decide whether targets/choices can change,whether dice are rerolled and how current legality,resources,components,recharge/concentration and actor position apply. Preserve the substantive full-round repeat instead of silently narrowing it to one attack. Distinguish new authorized events from replaying old outcomes or rewinding world history. Reject duplicate payment/award and recursive Echo chains through actual event lineage; specify what an impossible former action becomes without refunding already spent resources or inventing replacement actions."
      },
      "completeHistoricalCommonQuestionUnchanged": "For every selected spell, settle all operational fields: actual activation and components, legal target/range/geometry, duration and concentration, resolution/DC/save or attack, full effect clauses, scaling, repeat casting/source identity, suppression/ending, limits and class-specific rank/cost access. Preserve printed clauses and every original source. Explicitly label NEW completions; no external-game import or automatic historical alias merge.",
