          "newChoices": "NEW exact four-category information fields, hostile-intent predicate, private instantaneous snapshot and six-second understood-assertion window.",
          "questionId": "DI7-01",
          "originalQuestion": "Preserve revealing HIDDEN TRAPS,ENEMIES,MAGIC AND LIES in a60FT CONE,Core Action/60ft/Instantaneous. Define exact origin/geometry,recipient(s),line of effect and information supplied in each of the four categories. A lie needs a bounded spoken/asserted event and distinction between deliberate deception,error and unknown truth; no unrestricted mind-reading or complete truth replacement. Enemy classification and hidden traps/magic need actual source records,not thematic inference. Decide interaction with concealment and information protections explicitly while retaining the broad reveal promise. The spell reveals rather than disarms,triggers,damages,dispels or compels honesty. Paid resolution and materially unchanged inquiries must preserve uncertainty without fabricating facts.",
