          "completeProcedure": "KEEP Action/V/S/F, base 17 RP, one instantaneous 60-foot cone from the caster, and all four categories: hidden traps, enemies, magic and lies. NEW choose and record the cone direction at commitment; the caster alone receives the resolution-time snapshot, with no creature-count cap. The cone is an informational area, not a sight-required individual targeting attempt. Hidden or Invisible unprotected contents can qualify. Source-origin line of effect clips each readable portion; a wall cannot be bypassed merely because another sense sees through it.\n\nKEEP the previously authored DI7 cone template: 60-foot forward axial length, with circular cross-section diameter equal to forward axial distance. Before commitment, record actual source origin O, its nominated genuinely occupied source cell, and a nonzero facing vector. Normalize that vector by its Euclidean length to obtain unit direction F; do not snap it to a grid axis. A source may choose a forward origin on its own actual space boundary, recording the originating occupied source cell rather than treating both cells adjacent to that boundary as origin cells.\n\nFor a candidate cell center P, let V=P−O, a=dot(V,F), and W=V−aF. Geometric membership requires 0<a≤60 and 4×dot(W,W)≤a². Include equality at the lateral surface and far axial face; exclude the nominated origin cell. The 60-foot figure and rangeFeet:60 describe forward axial extent for this template. Apply no additional Euclidean or grid-metric 60-foot radial cap to its included cells. In particular, forward distance60 with perpendicular distance30 is inside. This exact template controls Mass Revelation’s shape rather than converting its circular sections into grid-metric squares.\n\nUse actual 3D cell centers and genuinely occupied body/feature/effect footprints. An empty part of a bounding box is not occupancy. Disclose only actual readable local portions within included cells after current source-origin line-of-effect, total-cover and existing no-corner-cutting clipping. Distance or a geometrically included cell supplies no path around a wall, no assumed vertical occupancy and no new sight-required targeting restriction on the cone’s hidden contents.\n\nNEW fixed-origin resolution rule: O, F and the nominated origin cell are fixed world-space records at commitment. Legal caster displacement or rotation does not translate or rotate this pending cone. Immediately before the snapshot, the recorded O must still be a legal origin within the caster’s current actual occupied space, or on its forward boundary under the stated boundary option. If it no longer qualifies, the committed cast produces no effect, with no refund, replacement origin or direction; it cannot project remotely from the caster’s former empty position. If O still qualifies, resolve the unchanged cone using current contents and current line of effect. Genuine departure and return before this checkpoint do not independently cancel the cast, although any other applicable interruption remains controlling. This adds no displacement permission, continuous sensor, second cast or general geometry rule.\n\nHidden traps: reveal the current physical site, occupied footprint, armed/dormant state and immediate trigger category of every actual readable trap. A concealed plate qualifies; an ordinary dangerous creature is not automatically a trap. No disarm solution, code, future die or automatic Search/disarm Action is granted. Enemies: reveal the current occupied footprint and readable creature count of actual beings presently intending or executing a meaningful hostile act against the caster or a member of the caster's current party. This NEW predicate is not alignment, species, reputation, mere disagreement or a caller's enemy flag. It reads no plan, memory, full identity or stat block. Intent, location and existence protections retain their independent actual scopes; never count protected existences.\n\nMagic: reveal each current actual magical effect's local footprint, spell/nonspell category, generating school/rank when its source supplies them, and active/suppressed state. A dormant enchanted object's still-existing enchantment may be distinguished from an active spell when readable; this does not invent charges, attunement, powers or an absent school/rank. Overlapping effects stay separate. Lies: NEW examine assertions made during the inclusive six elapsed seconds ending at resolution by a creature presently in the readable cone, only where the caster actually perceived and understood that assertion. Report deliberate deception when the speaker knowingly asserted what they then believed false; a sincere error is not a lie. Irony, uncertainty, misunderstood content, mere recorded sounds or a speaker now outside the area create no invented belief or objective replacement truth. Current relevant belief/existence protections still apply. A valid decoded sign can be an assertion; the spell supplies no language or general translation.\n\nNo generic save is added. An actual defense's own check/threshold applies only within its source scope. Apply the shared information rule without a free preflight search for hidden facts. The spell disarms, dispels, damages and compels nothing. CORRECTION to the proposal's blanket retained-concealment language: learning a location ends Hidden for this caster and removes Invisible's own attack modifiers against this informed observer, as already reviewed; it does not make an Invisible creature visible or satisfy a sight-required spell. Independent concealment still applies. The record is a snapshot, not a tracking feed. No ally receives the knowledge or observer-state change without actually obtaining that information through a legal channel.",
          "workedCases": [
            "DI7-01-A: Conditional Wizard13 has a legitimate prepared Mass Revelation, usable components, no price additions and RP48. Pay17 to31. The fixed readable cone contains an actual unprotected pressure plate, Invisible hostile scout and active ward. Disclose their specified fields. The scout stays Invisible, but this caster now knows its location: Hidden and Invisible-only attack modifiers end for this observer; independent darkness still applies, and a sight-required target remains unavailable. The plate stays armed and the ward stays active. Allies need actual communication.",
            "DI7-01-B: At resolution100, assertions at94 and99 are within the inclusive six-second window, provided their actual speakers remain in the cone and content was perceived/understood. The knowing false denial is identified; the sincere incorrect date is not. An assertion at93.999 is outside. Supply no key location or corrected date; an existence-protected mind adds no diagnostic record/count."
          ],
