        {
          "id": "LR-G20",
          "disposition": "KEEP receipt-only setting scope",
          "title": "Delivery and deferred receipts",
          "wording": "R3-04 Blink is receipt-only: retain its full original and question, current pending operational state and literal setting references; author no plane itinerary, probability, reappearance/body procedure or promotion. Other incidental literal names, including Silent Ones, Heartcell, Matrix, Voice and deep-language terms when present, remain source receipts without interpretation. Local portals/teleports below are explicitly local procedures, not a decision about cosmology. Source authority here does not certify gameplay runtime, human teaching/balance, bestiary/acquisition availability, DD01 or final systemic consistency. Owner's final whole-game flow precedes an authorized GitHub push; verified remote commit precedes careful cosmology review. No deletion/push is authorized.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/audit/2026-10-08/full-game/LOW_RANK_SPELL_FILE_HANDOFF_V3_SCOPE.md"
          ]
        }
      ],
