          "limitations": "The spell does not grant a reply, language comprehension, mind reading, command authority, guaranteed identity verification, communication through total cover or an effect explicitly blocking magical communication, or transmission across planes. The target hears the actual words used and may respond only through ordinary means. Cantrip repeats use Refrain.",
          "designNotes": "Core V2 Action, 120-foot range, Instantaneous duration, and V/S components are retained. The 25-word cap, direct-hearing procedure, and no-reply boundary are NEW provisional mechanics because the source only says to whisper to a creature within 120 feet. Conference correction: remove unsupported25-word limit; one Action bounds ordinary speech.",
