          "limitations": "Must be present before the roll and consumed before the d20 is rolled. Applies to one ability check only, not an attack roll, saving throw, damage roll, initiative roll unless initiative is explicitly treated as an ability check by the campaign rules, or another Guidance roll. Multiple Guidance effects do not stack. Cantrip repeats use Refrain.",
