  "sourceFindings": [
    "Mass Alignment Revelation includes all creatures in30ft radius, not just enemies. Accepted single-target revelation retains exact information protections and actual observer sight.",
    "Moment of Prescience retains the entire+10 and one-roll promise; roll categories, recipient and finite stored-use window remain explicit choices, not inferred Guidance limitations.",
    "Telepathy promises any-creature communication; current Message supplies no general mind-reading, comprehension or reply power. Type names alone are not mental immunity.",
    "Time Echo expressly repeats the full last ROUND for caster and one ally. The current extra-full-Action slot, ordinary BA/Reaction/movement budgets and resource histories expose real scope conflicts that must be decided, not silently narrowed.",
    "Fate Echo and Echo Cast have exact existing copy gates and paid/refrain/concentration rules; they are supplied in full but do not automatically authorize Time Echo.",
    "The six actual Control/Ready corrections are supplied as a complete proposed/unapplied return. Current local rule and authored-index membership remain unchanged.",
    "Divine Intervention Lesser and Reality Patch remain outside this mechanics cohort pending their separate divine/planar source discussions; their ordinary mechanical promises are not deleted.",
    "Historical tabletop source wording is preserved only as evidence; all new procedure choices target deterministic video-game execution."
  ],
  "futureCaseRequirements": [
    "At least two complete deterministic cases per spell after decisions, including actual acquired access/costs, world and observer state, chosen RNG, exact clocks and final records.",
    "Mass revelation: mixed actual alignments and individually protected/undefined axes, all-creature snapshot, hidden body with no location leak and publicly observable sigils.",
    "Prescience: chosen eligible roll, advantage/disadvantage and real source reroll, natural results, full+10 once, expired/suppressed use and same-name stacking.",
    "Telepathy: willing and unwilling actual creatures with different languages/cognition, ignored replies, no mind reading, real range/cover/plane/suppression and ending.",
    "Time Echo: complete last-round logs for both recipients with Actions/BA/Reaction/movement, one exceptional full replay sequence, real present resources/source routes, changed legal targets, concentration/strain and fresh outcomes.",
    "Time Echo: copied/action-grant ancestors rejected, existing source-wide limits conserved, unavailable source event consumes only its opportunity, real interruption/death and save/load no double replay.",
    "No runtime/balance success credit from incomplete actor history, undefined source adapters, fabricated profiles or isolated arithmetic."
  ],
